{"municipality_code":"04404","pref":"宮城県","city":"七ヶ浜町","headline":"公園・遊具や史跡・遺跡が、この街を歩く手がかりになりそうです。","display_comment_enriched":"七ヶ浜町では、湊浜、松ヶ浜、菖蒲田浜などの歴史地名を手がかりに、土地の成り立ちをたどれます。 周辺には古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「鼻節神社」、「吉田浜貝塚」、「二月田貝塚」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では湊浜、松ヶ浜に関わる地名碑や地域の歴史案内板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 ゆかりの人物では明瀬川傳四郎に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「主な神社」や「鼻節神社」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":17,"rank":752,"percentile":59.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":13,"rank":1500,"percentile":18.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":9,"rank":916,"percentile":46.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":1,"rank":1372,"percentile":15.9,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":5,"rank":804,"percentile":50.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["明瀬川傳四郎"],"tourism_landm